\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Late-window fitting and held-out accuracy separate sharply. Panels (a,b) show training accuracy; (c,d) show held-out accuracy, with a separate shared scale for each row. Values average the final five checkpoints. Colors encode decay; circles, squares, and triangles identify seeds 1009, 2027, and 3037, respectively. Short horizontal bars are condition means, not uncertainty intervals. The training axis is restricted to expose the narrow positive-decay fitting deficit; held-out accuracy remains far below the sustained generalization threshold in every condition.}}{6}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:outcomes}{{2}{6}{Late-window fitting and held-out accuracy separate sharply. Panels (a,b) show training accuracy; (c,d) show held-out accuracy, with a separate shared scale for each row. Values average the final five checkpoints. Colors encode decay; circles, squares, and triangles identify seeds 1009, 2027, and 3037, respectively. Short horizontal bars are condition means, not uncertainty intervals. The training axis is restricted to expose the narrow positive-decay fitting deficit; held-out accuracy remains far below the sustained generalization threshold in every condition}{figure.caption.6}{}}
